732
01:40:44,659 --> 01:40:45,119
Bu da

733
01:40:45,119 --> 01:40:47,159
alfa çarpı

734
01:40:47,159 --> 01:40:49,460
A çarpı

735
01:40:49,460 --> 01:40:50,260
B

736
01:40:50,260 --> 01:40:51,739
